  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/cucumber?source=modrinth\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex; text-align: center;\"><a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/docs/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=docs&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"https://blakesmods.com/wiki/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Cucumber 是一个包含共享代码与功能的模组，旨在为我的其他模组提供支持。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在启用高级工具提示时，为方块和物品添加显示其标签（Tags）的提示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在启用高级工具提示时，为物品添加显示其 NBT 数据的提示。（默认禁用）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #000000;\"><strong>我的其他模组</strong></span><span style=\"color: #008000; font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-agriculture\">Mystical Agriculture<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-agradditions\">Mystical Agradditions<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-automation\">Mystical Automation<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-customization\">Mystical Customization<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/extended-crafting\">Extended Crafting<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pickle-tweaks\">Pickle Tweaks<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/iron-jetpacks\">Iron Jetpacks<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-buckets\">More Buckets</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/blakesmods\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/fdf1b29a-987b-450e-b6d4-a16c2da8aadf.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></span></p>",
